  "notes": "3tentos Agroindustrial (TTEN3) \u2014 vertically-integrated Brazilian agribusiness based in Cruz Alta, RS. Three core verticals: (1) varejo de insumos (input retail to ~30k farmers in RS/MT/GO), (2) industrial (esmagamento de soja \u2192 farelo + \u00f3leo + biodiesel \u2014 3 plants: Cruz Alta-RS, Iju\u00ed-RS, Vilhena-RO), (3) gr\u00e3os (soybean/corn origination + trading). IPO on B3 Novo Mercado July 2021 (R$1.4B at R$10.50). BRL reporting, calendar fiscal year. grossRevenueMM = receita bruta, revenueMM = receita l\u00edquida. Expense split: CPV (cost of goods), G&A (despesas administrativas), D&A (deprecia\u00e7\u00e3o), Outras (logistics/comerciais). Material capex 2022-2024 to build Vilhena-RO biodiesel + crushing complex (R$1.5B+ project). Net debt elevated as a result. 5-year FY history from CVM ITR/DFP filings + ri.3tentos.com.br release decks. Pre-IPO 2020 figures from Prospecto Definitivo. Volume metrics: ~3M tonnes soja crushed in FY24, ~1M tonnes biodiesel produced, ~R$3B in input retail receita.",
